 "description": "<p>A rose-styled mask in silicone with a 60 cm strap length and a 4.2 cm rose diameter, in black or red. Silicone is the material upgrade in the mask format - it flexes, warms to skin, and cleans properly.</p>\n<p>The rose sits at the center per the pictures, and the strap adjusts through the 60 cm length. Black and red are the two registers, elegant and dramatic.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: silicone</li>\n<li>Item type: mask</li>\n<li>Style: rose centerpiece</li>\n<li>Color: black or red</li>\n<li>Specs: strap 60 cm, rose diameter 4.2 cm</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Printed specs, two colorways. The premium-material option in a mask category that mostly runs lace and leather.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Silicone rose mask in black or red, 60 cm strap, 4.2 cm rose, flexible body-safe material.</p>\n",
